24→// Width is set as a percentage of the overlay container width via inline style.
25→// aspect-ratio: 1 derives the height from that width, keeping the dot circular
26→// and proportionally scaled at any screen size.
27→.note-marker {
28→  position: absolute;
29→  aspect-ratio: 1;
30→  border-radius: 50%;
31→  background-color: var(--gt-accent);
